                                                "sense_id": "d9ac4a40-3bdf-361c-981e-d79ac4b594d5",
                                                "text": "Hypothesis 6.14: Entropy levels within the social group may vary but must be maintained below maximum entropy on certain relevant variables (e.g., on the six globals and five mutables)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
